  "title": "Herrerasaurus ischigualastensis",
  "summary": "Herrerasaurus ischigualastensis was an early, meat-eating dinosaur of the Late Triassic, about 6 m long, known only from the Ischigualasto Formation of northwestern Argentina. Its Carnian-age rocks are dated to about 231 million years ago, and a complete skull found in 1988 helped clarify its place among early dinosaurs.",
